{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210260/extras/7dfbc098e81971627a07ab84e54bcbf3.avif?t=1745350559\" data-has-big width=800 height=65 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210260/extras/ade1804eed967261394c34056c0e0d33.poster.avif?t=1745350559\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210260/extras/ade1804eed967261394c34056c0e0d33.webm?t=1745350559\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210260/extras/ade1804eed967261394c34056c0e0d33.mp4?t=1745350559\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Every floor is it's own world full of traps and enemies. Your mission? Survive. Fix the elevator. Go deeper. Repeat.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210260/extras/65f630da908cfa42282583423feff638.avif?t=1745350559\" data-has-big width=800 height=65 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210260/extras/042028f00af5c6ea21b6f448a80e1837.poster.avif?t=1745350559\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210260/extras/042028f00af5c6ea21b6f448a80e1837.webm?t=1745350559\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210260/extras/042028f00af5c6ea21b6f448a80e1837.mp4?t=1745350559\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Team up with up to 3 friends to tackle the facility, you\u2019ll need to work together\u2014or split up to cover more ground. Just make sure someone\u2019s there to pick you up when things go wrong.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210260/extras/6f7cedb1612fd3c8b281f1e3f477f172.avif?t=1745350559\" data-has-big width=800 height=65 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210260/extras/4d7b61a8c54aa923f38ee2ce37ff9375.poster.avif?t=1745350559\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210260/extras/4d7b61a8c54aa923f38ee2ce37ff9375.webm?t=1745350559\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210260/extras/4d7b61a8c54aa923f38ee2ce37ff9375.mp4?t=1745350559\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Every time you play, the dungeon changes. No two floors are alike, and you\u2019ll have to adapt to whatever the game throws at you\u2014whether it's deadly traps, deadly enemies, or special challenges that\u2019ll test your reflexes.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210260/extras/321bc9251d0574fb68570505e6f65d38.avif?t=1745350559\" data-has-big width=800 height=65 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210260/extras/f1f07cfd572793e2ec6fbaf24b2ed039.poster.avif?t=174535055